Costroid is the cost check for pull requests.

On your machine                       In a workflow job
  demo      print an example comment    report        post the check and comment
  lint      judge agent workflows       ingest-run    write rows after a run
  init      write the workflow          follow-up     post a fork's check
  doctor    check a repository          approve       post an approved check
  run       run an agent under a cap    review        post the agent's answer
  policy    give the verdict offline    result        print a check's result
  validate  check costroid.yml          mcp           answer an agent over MCP
  version   print the release           lint-recipes  check Costroid's recipes

To a platform                         For a ledger of your own
  export     send or convert rows       serve      run the ingest service
  merged     send merge facts           keys       issue and revoke keys
  connect    bind an owner              egress     report outbound calls
  emit-otlp  send rows as OTLP spans    gateway    give a run its own key
                                        app        register the GitHub App
                                        reconcile  compare with a provider

Example, with nothing set up:  costroid demo
Help for one command:          costroid help <command>
Documentation:                 https://docs.costroid.com
